Match an exact checkpoint to your accelerator and LLMD release. Check the
[host and backend requirements]($link.page('reference/compatibility'))
and allow memory for both the model weights and KV cache.

# [Checkpoint catalog]($heading.id('choose-a-checkpoint'))

Precision describes the checkpoint weights. The LLMD release comes from the
pinned quickstart or the upstream post that published the recipe. On narrow
screens, scroll the table sideways to see all columns.

